": "🎯 Problem: a researcher holds a subjective concept they cannot define up front. Today\nthey write a codebook first, before seeing the data: it misses hard cases, and no one can\nsay how well a labeler follows it.", "originalText": "🎯 Problem: a researcher holds a subjective concept they cannot define up front. Today\nthey write a codebook first, before seeing the data: it misses hard cases, and no one can\nsay how well a labeler follows it.", "fontSize": 38, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-f73c7d4d3288", "type": "rectangle", "x": 11325.0, "y": 932.5, "width": 1675.0, "height": 284.375, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-c3a78203c285", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 8, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 8, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_s-d5c5eae05545", "type": "text", "x": 11355.0, "y": 955.0, "width": 1616.0375000000001, "height": 234.375, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-c3a78203c285", "roundness": null, "seed": 9, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 9, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "🏆 Contributions: a tool to build your own benchmark, then pick the labeler for all your data\n· C1 an interactive guideline: drawn out on real data, every rule yours (✨1) · C2 it transfers:\na weak model following G* labels like you · C3 a benchmark that knows where it is unsure;\nquick: you read only borders (✨2), rounds pick the most valuable (✨3), a sealed exam\n(✨4).", "originalText": "🏆 Contributions: a tool to build your own 