c", "type": "text", "x": 13350.0, "y": 2490.625, "width": 2085.87109375, "height": 40.625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-bcb03628cf82", "roundness": null, "seed": 1229, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1229, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· 7 pools each round: H, L, N when both models give that label, sure; HL, LN, HN between two; HLN when the definition does not cover it", "originalText": "· 7 pools each round: H, L, N when both models give that label, sure; HL, LN, HN between two; HLN when the definition does not cover it", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-063e652459d5", "type": "text", "x": 13350.0, "y": 2538.75, "width": 1805.3132812500003, "height": 40.625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-bcb03628cf82", "roundness": null, "seed": 1230, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1230, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· the map flags 🧭 an H, L or N item whose gold neighbours differ; you rule the open pools and the 🧭, and that is gold", "originalText": "· the map flags 🧭 an H, L or N item whose gold neighbours differ; you rule the open pools and the 🧭, and that is gold", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-e5f6fa8d6e77", "type": "text", "x": 13350.0, "y": 2586.875, "width": 2097.29921875, "height": 40.625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-bcb03628cf82", "roundness": null, "seed": 1231, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1231, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· Gold is only what you rule; H, L, N labels are kept, never gold. After a rule changes, every item is labeled again. Counts are an example.", "originalText": "· Gold is only what you rule; H, L, N labels are kept, never gold. After a rule changes, every item is labeled again. Counts are an example.", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-a0af063f16f4", "type": "text", "x": 13350.0, "y": 2645.0, "width": 1361.414453125, "height": 34.375, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-bcb03628cf82", "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "✎ 261014 every item in one of 7 pools each round: H L N grow, HL LN HN HLN shrink · Ⓑ and Ⓒ in one", "originalText": "✎ 261014 every item in one of 7 pools each round: H L N grow, HL LN HN HLN shrink · Ⓑ and Ⓒ in one", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-378b57f06a1d", "type": "rectangle", "x": 15406.25, "y": 420.0, "width": 687.5, "height": 92.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-bcb03628cf82", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1233, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1233, "isDeleted": false, 